41:**Roster.** The practice's patients, as its EHR lists them. A patient with a live Duet connection is active, and Coda works on active patients first. A patient in the EHR with no connection stays on the roster, to the side, as not active. Hint Health and Elation FHIR supply and keep the practice's patient roster current through their adapters.
300:- **The schedule**, supplied by Hint Health and Elation FHIR through their adapters.
